{"id":"a09db7c2dab60d0a","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-strongly-minimal-theory.md","title":"Strongly Minimal Theory","display":"df-strongly-minimal-theory — Strongly Minimal Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-strongly-minimal-theory","aliases":["17-df-strongly-minimal-theory"],"display":"df-strongly-minimal-theory — Strongly Minimal Theory","depends_on":["[[17-df-theory-properties]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-7.1.4","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-strongly-minimal-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-strongly-minimal-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strongly-minimal-theory — Strongly Minimal Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d88aa28a0fcc379a\" href=\"?note=d88aa28a0fcc379a\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-set\">17-df-strongly-minimal-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-7.1.4"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> (theory-completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (models of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\)</span> (strongly minimal definable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d88aa28a0fcc379a\" href=\"?note=d88aa28a0fcc379a\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-set\">17-df-strongly-minimal-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyMinimalTheory}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyMinimalTheory}_L\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyMinimalTheory}_L(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\n(|\\mathfrak{A}|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StronglyMinimalTheory}_L(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\n(|\\mathfrak{A}|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Thus every model is infinite and every unary subset definable with parameters is\nfinite or cofinite.  These requirements are inherited from the canonical\nstrongly-minimal-set predicate rather than restated with cardinal arithmetic.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-strongly-minimal-set","status":"resolved","id":"d88aa28a0fcc379a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8